Package: relay-linkd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Relay Link Maintainers <relay-link@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6, systemd
Description: Relay Link server and relay backend
 Relay Link forwards aircraft telemetry between relay and server roles.
 This package also includes the pinned media helpers used by the managed
 video pipeline and systemd units for both supported backend roles.
